{"id":"vod_bf_19042","vodId":"19042","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"来自风平浪静的明天","name_cn":"来自风平浪静的明天","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-20/5ccd1629f44302ae4f1dc5f73ca6756f.jpg"},"summary":"因为所在的波路中学倒闭，新学期一开始，先岛光（花江夏树 配音）和青梅竹马向井户爱花（花泽香菜 配音）以及好友比良平千咲（茅野爱衣 配音）、伊佐木要（逢坂良太 配音）转校至位于陆地的美滨中学继续学业。先岛和朋友们是生活在海底的海之民，传说很久以前人类全部始于大海，大有一部分人迷恋陆地的生活，而放弃了神赐予的“胞衣”。千百年来，陆之民和海之民在摩擦中共存，他们之间有矛盾，有误会，也有憧憬和向往。在新的学校，先岛和爱花结识了生活在海边的少年木原纺（石川界人 饰）。　　来自不同的种族，少男少女别样的青春故事就此上演……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 23:58:19","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizifengpinglangjingdemingtian/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizifengpinglangjingdemingtian/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizifengpinglangjingdemingtian/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizifengpinglangjingdemingtian/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizifengpinglangjingdemingtian/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizifengpinglangjingdemingtian/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizifengpinglangjingdemingtian/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizifengpinglangjingdemingtian/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizifengpinglangjingdemingtian/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizifengpinglangjingdemingtian/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizifengpinglangjingdemingtian/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laizifengpinglangjingdemingtian/第